# The right side of `join` and `union` is a table without `from`; a pipeline there is parenthesized and starts with `from`.
mode: syntax
---- query
from orders | join customers on customerId;
from orders | join (from 'c.csv' | where active) on id;
from 'a.csv' | union 'b.csv', (from 'c.csv' | where active)
---- expected
